    <description>The list comprises the remaining leads of SDR, Pauline Dorsey&apos;s, leads as of year end 2019.  AE&apos;s name&apos;s in column heading &quot;Street Line 2&quot;, designates potential owner of the lead.  These designations support the Inside Consumption Territory Map 2020.</description>
    <filter>
